      "content": "people want to help, but they don't get it. they see the hero, not the person who's actually broken. it's not even about wanting to die really, it's just that the noise is so loud and the constant struggle feels so heavy. i just want the noise to stop. wouldn't it be easier if everything just... went quiet? if there was just peace instead of all this chaos?",
